                            <comment id="17739433" author="JIRAUSER297438" created="Mon, 3 Jul 2023 03:22:21 +0000"  >&lt;h1&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;FixDesign%3A&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Fix Design:&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p&gt;change&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; [[ &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;${kerberosEnabled}&quot;&lt;/span&gt; == &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;false&lt;/span&gt;&quot;&lt;/span&gt; || -f ${BYPASS} ]] &lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;to&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; [[ &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;${kerberosEnabled}&quot;&lt;/span&gt; != &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;&quot;&lt;/span&gt; || -f ${BYPASS} ]]&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This ensures that the jar is not replaced when kerberosEnabled is empty&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
